{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "rate_limit_tiers", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.88349, "final_answer": "The Starter tier allows 60 requests per minute, Growth allows 300 requests per minute, and Business allows 1,200 requests per minute. [doc:doc_rate_limits] Northwind Cloud enforces API rate limits per project. [doc:doc_rate_limits]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_rate_limits", "doc_refunds", "doc_billing_plans"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.8835125, "latency_ms": 0.2964000013889745, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 15, "completion_tokens": 57, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_c95c9c81", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "sla_standard_uptime", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.884575, "final_answer": "Northwind Cloud guarantees 99.9% monthly uptime on the standard tier and 99.95% on the Business plan. [doc:doc_sla] The credit formula works as follows: 5% of the monthly fee for every 0.1% of downtime below the target, so credit percentage equals missed uptime divided by 0.1, multiplied by 5, capped at 50% of one monthly fee. [doc:doc_sla]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_sla", "doc_support_tiers", "doc_billing_plans"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.8845904, "latency_ms": 0.26420000358484685, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 13, "completion_tokens": 85, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_3ca13700", "schema_version": "1.1"}
