{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "encryption_at_rest", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.886448, "final_answer": "All data stored on Northwind Cloud is encrypted at rest with AES-256, using keys managed by the platform key service. [doc:doc_encryption] Encryption keys rotate automatically every 90 days, and Business plan customers can trigger a manual key rotation from the console at any time. [doc:doc_encryption]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_encryption", "doc_export", "doc_sla"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.8864663, "latency_ms": 0.28569999267347157, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 11, "completion_tokens": 75, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_a6a0837e", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "onboarding_api_key", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.8877463, "final_answer": "Setting up Northwind Cloud takes about ten minutes. [doc:doc_onboarding] Third, open the console and generate an API key under Settings and then Keys; the secret is displayed only once, so copy it into a secure store. [doc:doc_onboarding]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_onboarding", "doc_encryption", "doc_rate_limits"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.8877668, "latency_ms": 0.31489999673794955, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 15, "completion_tokens": 59, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_7b5dc022", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "plans_starter_price", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.8888245, "final_answer": "The Starter tier allows 60 requests per minute, Growth allows 300 requests per minute, and Business allows 1,200 requests per minute. [doc:doc_rate_limits] Usage is counted in rolling one-minute windows, and every response carries an X-RateLimit-Remaining header showing the remaining budget. [doc:doc_rate_limits]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_rate_limits", "doc_support_tiers", "doc_refunds"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.888844, "latency_ms": 0.28700000257231295, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 16, "completion_tokens": 78, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_b16aec53", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "status_severities", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.8898177, "final_answer": "The Northwind Cloud status page is published at status.northwind.cloud and shows real-time health for every region and for core services such as the API, console, and dashboard. [doc:doc_status_page] Incidents use three severity levels: severity 1 marks a full outage, severity 2 marks degraded performance, and severity 3 marks a minor issue without customer impact. [doc:doc_status_page]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_status_page", "doc_regions", "doc_sla"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.889834, "latency_ms": 0.24440001288894564, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 15, "completion_tokens": 97, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_0f2cb823", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "support_growth_email", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.8906906, "final_answer": "Growth adds email support with a first response within 24 hours, available around the clock. [doc:doc_support_tiers] Support options depend on the plan. [doc:doc_support_tiers]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_support_tiers", "doc_rate_limits", "doc_onboarding"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.890704, "latency_ms": 0.27260000933893025, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 17, "completion_tokens": 44, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_a81bac03", "schema_version": "1.1"}
{"run_id": "run_6bd74c98", "case_id": "export_processing_time", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "style": "faithful", "weighting": "idf", "allow_irrelevant": false}, "started_at": 1795046301.8916042, "final_answer": "When a project is deleted, associated data is purged within 24 hours, while backups simply expire on their normal schedule. [doc:doc_data_retention] Customers who need data removed sooner can request earlier deletion at any time by opening a support ticket; deletion on request finishes within 72 hours and is irreversible. [doc:doc_data_retention]", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_data_retention", "doc_export", "doc_billing_plans"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "v2_improved.invoke", "started_at": 1795046301.8916183, "latency_ms": 0.3226999979233369, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 11, "completion_tokens": 87, "token_source": "heuristic"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_e77a8315", "schema_version": "1.1"}
